<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>name</key>
	<string>Paradox Script</string>
	<key>scopeName</key>
	<string>source.paradox</string>
	<key>patterns</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#comment</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#string</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#macro-param</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#inline-math</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#script-constant</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#date</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#event-id</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#number</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#constant</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#color-model</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#asset-ref</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#saved-scope</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#scope-ref</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#iterator</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#control</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#block-key</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#loc-property</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#value-ref</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#operator</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>include</key>
			<string>#braces</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>repository</key>
	<dict>
		<key>comment</key>
		<dict>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>comment.line.number-sign.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>#.*$</string>
		</dict>
		<key>string</key>
		<dict>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>string.quoted.double.paradox</string>
			<key>begin</key>
			<string>"</string>
			<key>end</key>
			<string>"</string>
			<key>patterns</key>
			<array>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>constant.character.escape.paradox</string>
					<key>match</key>
					<string>\\.</string>
				</dict>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>variable.other.substitution.paradox</string>
					<key>match</key>
					<string>\$[A-Za-z0-9_.|\-]+\$</string>
				</dict>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>support.function.databinding.paradox</string>
					<key>match</key>
					<string>\[[^\]]*\]</string>
				</dict>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>constant.other.formatting.paradox</string>
					<key>match</key>
					<string>#[!A-Za-z_;]+</string>
				</dict>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<key>macro-param</key>
		<dict>
			<key>comment</key>
			<string>$PARAM$ substitution in scripted effects/triggers, incl. $NAME|default$</string>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>variable.parameter.macro.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>\$[A-Za-z0-9_.|\-]+\$</string>
		</dict>
		<key>script-constant</key>
		<dict>
			<key>comment</key>
			<string>@name script constants (@pos_compat_low = 0.5 and their uses)</string>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>variable.other.constant.script.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>@[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\b</string>
		</dict>
		<key>inline-math</key>
		<dict>
			<key>comment</key>
			<string>@[ ... ] inline math over script constants</string>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>meta.inline-math.paradox</string>
			<key>begin</key>
			<string>@\[</string>
			<key>end</key>
			<string>\]</string>
			<key>beginCaptures</key>
			<dict>
				<key>0</key>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>punctuation.section.math.begin.paradox</string>
				</dict>
			</dict>
			<key>endCaptures</key>
			<dict>
				<key>0</key>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>punctuation.section.math.end.paradox</string>
				</dict>
			</dict>
			<key>patterns</key>
			<array>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>constant.numeric.paradox</string>
					<key>match</key>
					<string>-?\d+(\.\d+)?</string>
				</dict>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>keyword.operator.arithmetic.paradox</string>
					<key>match</key>
					<string>[-+*/%()]</string>
				</dict>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>variable.other.constant.script.paradox</string>
					<key>match</key>
					<string>[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*</string>
				</dict>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<key>date</key>
		<dict>
			<key>comment</key>
			<string>Y.M.D with optional hour component (Y.M.D.H) — title history uses 4-part dates</string>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>constant.numeric.date.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>\b\d{1,4}\.\d{1,2}\.\d{1,2}(?:\.\d{1,2})?\b</string>
		</dict>
		<key>event-id</key>
		<dict>
			<key>comment</key>
			<string>Event IDs: namespace.NNNN — visually distinct so event chains stand out</string>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>entity.name.function.event-id.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>\b[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_\-]*\.\d+\b(?!\.\d)</string>
		</dict>
		<key>number</key>
		<dict>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>constant.numeric.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>(?&lt;![\w.])-?\d+(\.\d+)?(?![\w.])</string>
		</dict>
		<key>constant</key>
		<dict>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>constant.language.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>\b(yes|no|none)\b</string>
		</dict>
		<key>color-model</key>
		<dict>
			<key>comment</key>
			<string>color = rgb { 255 0 0 } / hsv { 0.5 1 1 } / hsv360 { 180 100 100 }: the model tag before the block</string>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>support.type.color-model.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>\b(rgb|hsv360|hsv)\b(?=\s*\{)</string>
		</dict>
		<key>asset-ref</key>
		<dict>
			<key>comment</key>
			<string>Art/sound reference values (icon = X.dds, animation = happiness, entity = …): the value reads as an unquoted string so asset names aren't invisible</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>\b(icon|texture|entity|animation|scripted_animation|camera|soundeffect|clicksound|environment|ambience|reference)\s*(=)\s*([A-Za-z0-9_][A-Za-z0-9_.\\/\-]*)(?![A-Za-z0-9_:])</string>
			<key>captures</key>
			<dict>
				<key>1</key>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>entity.name.tag.block.paradox</string>
				</dict>
				<key>2</key>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>keyword.operator.comparison.paradox</string>
				</dict>
				<key>3</key>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>string.unquoted.reference.paradox</string>
				</dict>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<key>saved-scope</key>
		<dict>
			<key>comment</key>
			<string>scope:x / var:x / flag:x references — the mod's own runtime state</string>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>variable.other.saved-scope.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>\b(scope|var|local_var|global_var|flag|event_target|define|list|title|character|province|culture|faith|dynasty|house|religion|trait|vassal_contract|struggle|epidemic):[A-Za-z0-9_.\-]+\b</string>
		</dict>
		<key>scope-ref</key>
		<dict>
			<key>comment</key>
			<string>Built-in scope navigation (root/this/prev/from and common scope-changer links). ROOT/THIS/PREV/FROM: vanilla uses the uppercase forms too (portrait blocks etc.)</string>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>variable.language.scope.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>\b(root|ROOT|this|THIS|prev(prev)*|PREV(PREV)*|from(from)*|FROM(FROM)*|liege|holder|mother|father|primary_spouse|primary_title|primary_heir|player_heir|capital_province|capital_county|capital_barony|top_liege|court_owner|employer|county|duchy|kingdom|empire|barony|province|location|culture_head|faith|culture|religion|dynasty|house|betrothed|host|killer|imprisoner|realm_priest|designated_heir|ghw_beneficiary|involved_activity|activity|activity_host|story_owner|secret_owner|secret_target|scheme_owner|scheme_target|title_province|county_controller|barony_controller|province_owner|current_travel_plan|court_position_employer|accolade_owner)\b(?=\s*[.=]|\s*$|\s)</string>
		</dict>
		<key>iterator</key>
		<dict>
			<key>comment</key>
			<string>List iterators: any_ (trigger), every_/random_/ordered_ (effects)</string>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>keyword.operator.iterator.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>\b(any|every|random|ordered)_[a-z0-9_]+\b</string>
		</dict>
		<key>control</key>
		<dict>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>keyword.control.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>\b(if|else_if|else|while|switch|trigger_if|trigger_else_if|trigger_else|AND|OR|NOT|NOR|NAND|and|or|not|nor|nand|limit|alternative_limit|filter|namespace|first_valid|random_valid|triggered_desc|hidden_effect|hidden_trigger|show_as_tooltip|custom_description|custom_tooltip|calc_true_if|exists|always|save_scope_as|save_scope_value_as|save_temporary_scope_as|save_temporary_scope_value_as|clear_saved_scope|add_to_list|add_to_temporary_list|remove_from_list|is_in_list|random_list|duel|send_interface_toast|send_interface_message|trigger_event)\b</string>
		</dict>
		<key>block-key</key>
		<dict>
			<key>comment</key>
			<string>Structural block keys that shape events/decisions/interactions</string>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>entity.name.tag.block.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>\b(type|hidden|trigger|immediate|effect|option|after|potential|allow|can_pick|ai_chance|ai_will_do|ai_potential|is_shown|is_valid|is_valid_showing_failures_only|on_accept|on_decline|on_send|on_start|on_end|on_complete|on_invalidated|modifier|compare_modifier|opinion_modifier|weight|weight_multiplier|desc|title|theme|override_background|left_portrait|right_portrait|center_portrait|lower_left_portrait|lower_center_portrait|lower_right_portrait|animation|scaled_by|min|max|value|add|multiply|divide|subtract|factor|base|days|weeks|months|years|duration|target|order_by|position|chance|cost|gold|piety|prestige)\s*(?=\??=)</string>
		</dict>
		<key>loc-property</key>
		<dict>
			<key>comment</key>
			<string>Any other key on the left of = reads as a property; keeps key/value texture visible</string>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>variable.other.property.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_.\-]*\s*(?=\??=)</string>
		</dict>
		<key>value-ref</key>
		<dict>
			<key>comment</key>
			<string>Catch-all for bare identifiers in value position (trait = brave, list entries). Without a base scope they render default-foreground until the server's semantic tokens land — the 'text stays white for a while' reports. Same string colour family as asset-ref; semantic tokens refine it once the index answers.</string>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>string.unquoted.value.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_.\-]*\b</string>
		</dict>
		<key>operator</key>
		<dict>
			<key>name</key>
			<string>keyword.operator.comparison.paradox</string>
			<key>match</key>
			<string>(\?=|&gt;=|&lt;=|!=|==|=|&lt;|&gt;)</string>
		</dict>
		<key>braces</key>
		<dict>
			<key>patterns</key>
			<array>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>punctuation.section.block.begin.paradox</string>
					<key>match</key>
					<string>\{</string>
				</dict>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>punctuation.section.block.end.paradox</string>
					<key>match</key>
					<string>\}</string>
				</dict>
				<dict>
					<key>name</key>
					<string>punctuation.section.brackets.paradox</string>
					<key>match</key>
					<string>[\[\]]</string>
				</dict>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</dict>
</dict>
</plist>
